      "value": "subject_definitions: \n<Subject 1> is LARN, blond braided hair, sun-tanned bronze skin, gold hoop earrings, a leather belt with a gold buckle, and a bone necklace, shown in <Picture 1> \u2014 the character sheet for LARN.\n<Subject 2> is TEEGRA, long black hair, pale skin, green eyes, a lightweight purple two-piece costume, and a gold necklace, shown in <Picture 2> \u2014 the character sheet for TEEGRA.\n<Picture 1> is a reference sheet of <Subject 1>, showing the same person from several angles.\n<Picture 2> is a reference sheet of <Subject 2>, showing the same person from several angles.\n<Picture 3> is a location plate for the jungle environment.\n\nsummary: \n[reference generation] A technicolor 80s sword-and-sandals epic, shot on 35mm: a single continuous live-action scene of <Subject 1> and <Subject 2>, preserving each character's appearance from their reference sheet and the spoken dialogue and timing of the reference audio.\n\nretention_analysis: \n<Subject 1> and <Subject 2> are fully preserved \u2014 keep their appearances consistent across the shot.\nReference audio: fully copied \u2014 reuse the spoken lines and their exact timing.\n<Picture 3>: background only \u2014 the location as a painted environment: keep its layout, lighting, colour, and architecture.\n\ndetailed_description: \nA technicolor 80s sword-and-sandals epic, shot on 35mm: vivid saturated colour, deep blacks, and high contrast, practical sets, high-fantasy practical effects on an unlimited budget, lush tropical jungle against vast ruined stone, gold shafts of light through the canopy, humid haze.\nIn this shot, <Subject 1> and <Subject 2> are seated in the jungle environment, with <Subject 1> holding <Subject 2>'s hands. The camera arcs around them with small amplitude at slow speed. <Subject 1> (S1) says: <d>[English] Not so close, you'll burn it.</d> <Subject 2> (S2) says: <d>[English] I've always lived close to a fire.</d> <Subject 2> (S2) says: <d>[English] Sometimes in the night, I'm so afraid.</d> <Subject 1> (S1) says: <d>[English] It's getting colder.</d>\n\noverall_soundscape: \nBirdsong and insect noise close to the mic, leaves and undergrowth moving, air moving through the canopy."
